{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_20_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_20","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，紀季姜歸於京師。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_20_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_20","textTraditional":"為之中者，歸之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_20_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_20","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_20_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_20","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_20_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_20","textTraditional":"四、冬，曹伯使其世子射姑來朝。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_20_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_20","textTraditional":"朝不言使，言使非正也。使世子伉諸侯之禮而來朝，曹伯失正矣。諸侯相見曰朝。以待人父之道待人之子，以內為失正矣。內失正，曹伯失正，世子可以已矣。則是故命也。尸子曰：「夫已，多乎道。」","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}